      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After 5 hours at 800 °C in air, the Al-modified alloy will have lower oxidation mass gain than untreated equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After 5 hours at 800 °C in air, the Al-modified alloy will exhibit less oxide-scale spallation than untreated equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr.",
